},{"id":"c-jinshu-066-taokan:p004:m0230","surface":"母","start":230,"end":231,"person_id":"yc7_yxx_7te","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-066-taokan","book_id":"b-jinshu-066","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-066-taokan-ws1527632"},{"id":"c-jinshu-066-taokan:p005","text":"服闋，參東海王越軍事。江州刺史華軼表侃為揚武將軍，使屯夏口，又以臻為參軍。軼與元帝素不平，臻懼難作，托疾而歸，白侃曰：「華彥夏有憂天下之志，而才不足，且與琅邪不平，難將作矣。」侃怒，遣臻還軼。臻遂東歸於帝。帝見之，大悅，命臻為參軍，加侃奮威將軍，假赤幢曲蓋軺車、鼓吹。侃乃與華軼告絕。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":37,"last_line":37,"raw_start":3746,"raw_end":3890,"raw_character_offsets":[3748,3749,3750,3751,3752,3753,3754,3755,3756,3757,3758,3759,3760,3761,3762,3763,3764,3765,3766,3767,3768,3769,3770,3771,3772,3773,3774,3775,3776,3777,3778,3779,3780,3781,3782,3783,3784,3785,3786,3787,3788,3789,3790,3791,3792,3793,3794,3795,3796,3797,3798,3799,3800,3801,3802,3803,3804,3805,3806,3807,3808,3809,3810,3811,3812,3813,3814,3815,3816,3817,3818,3819,3820,3821,3822,3823,3824,3825,3826,3827,3828,3829,3830,3831,3832,3833,3834,3835,3836,3837,3838,3839,3840,3841,3842,3843,3844,3845,3846,3847,3848,3849,3850,3851,3852,3853,3854,3855,3856,3857,3858,3859,3860,3861,3862,3863,3864,3865,3866,3867,3868,3869,3870,3871,3872,3873,3874,3875,3876,3877,3878,3879,3880,3881,3882,3883,3884,3885,3886,3887,3888,3889],"revision_id":1527632},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-066-taokan:p005:m0004","surface":"東海王越","start":4,"end":8,"person_id":"9o2_vhv_r7y","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-066-taokan:p005:m0015","surface":"華軼","start":15,"end":17,"person_id":"p86_bh6_jm2","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-066-taokan:p005:m0018","surface":"侃","start":18,"end":19,"person_id":"twd_erg_kmz","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-066-taokan:p005:m0032","surface":"臻","start":32,"end":33,"person_id":"zyf_30n_e5t","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-066-taokan:p005:m0039","surface":"元帝","start":39,"end":41,"person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-066-taokan:p005:m0060","surface":"華彥夏","start":60,"end":63,"person_id":"p86_bh6_jm2","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-066-taokan:p005:m0137","surface":"華軼","start":137,"end":139,"person_id":"p86_bh6_jm2","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-066-taokan","book_id":"b-jinshu-066","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-066-taokan-ws1527632"},{"id":"c-jinshu-066-taokan:p017","text":"遣子斌與南中郎將桓宣西伐樊城，走石勒將郭敬。使兄子臻、竟陵太守李陽等共破新野，遂平襄陽。拜大將軍，劍履上殿，入朝不趨，贊拜不名。上表固讓，曰：「臣非貪於疇昔，而虛讓於今日。事有合于時宜，臣豈敢與陛下有違；理有益於聖世，臣豈與朝廷作異。臣常欲除諸浮長之事，遣諸虛假之用，非獨臣身而已。若臣杖國威靈，梟雄斬勒，則又何以加！」咸和七年六月疾篤，又上表遜位曰：","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":61,"last_line":61,"raw_start":7557,"raw_end":7742,"raw_character_offsets":[7559,7560,7561,7562,7563,7564,7565,7566,7567,7568,7569,7570,7571,7572,7573,7574,7575,7576,7577,7578,7579,7580,7581,7582,7583,7584,7585,7586,7587,7588,7589,7590,7591,7592,7593,7594,7595,7596,7597,7598,7599,7600,7601,7602,7603,7604,7605,7606,7607,7608,7609,7610,7611,7612,7613,7614,7615,7616,7617,7618,7619,7620,7621,7622,7623,7624,7625,7626,7627,7628,7629,7630,7631,7632,7633,7634,7635,7636,7637,7638,7639,7640,7641,7642,7643,7644,7645,7646,7647,7648,7649,7650,7651,7652,7653,7654,7655,7656,7657,7658,7659,7660,7661,7662,7663,7664,7665,7666,7667,7668,7669,7670,7671,7672,7673,7674,7675,7676,7677,7678,7679,7680,7681,7682,7683,7684,7685,7686,7687,7688,7689,7690,7691,7692,7693,7694,7695,7696,7697,7698,7699,7700,7701,7702,7703,7704,7705,7706,7707,7708,7709,7710,7711,7712,7713,7714,7715,7716,7717,7718,7724,7725,7726,7727,7730,7731,7732,7733,7734,7735,7736,7737,7738,7739,7740,7741],"revision_id":1527632},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-066-taokan:p017:m0002","surface":"斌","start":2,"end":3,"person_id":"byj_6mo_vpe","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-066-taokan:p017:m0008","surface":"桓宣","start":8,"end":10,"person_id":"qak_wzz_t6i","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-066-taokan:p017:m0016","surface":"石勒","start":16,"end":18,"person_id":"0c9_95a_18b","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-066-taokan:p017:m0019","surface":"郭敬","start":19,"end":21,"person_id":"jaj_wtk_lgm","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-066-taokan:p017:m0025","surface":"臻","start":25,"end":26,"person_id":"zyf_30n_e5t","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-066-taokan:p017:m0031","surface":"李陽","start":31,"end":33,"person_id":"3se_4j0_fhb","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-066-taokan","book_id":"b-jinshu-066","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-066-taokan-ws1527632"},{"id":"c-jinshu-066-taoyu:p001","text":"臻弟輿，果烈善戰，以功累遷武威將軍。初，賊張奕本中州人，元康中被差西征，遇天下亂，遂留蜀。至是，率三百餘家欲就杜弢，為侃所獲。諸將請殺其丁壯，取其妻息，輿曰：「此本官兵，數經戰陣，可赦之以為用。」侃赦之，以配輿。及侃與杜弢戰敗，賊以桔槔打沒官軍船艦，軍中失色。輿率輕舸出其上流以擊之，所向輒克。賊又率眾將焚侃輜重，輿又擊破之。自是每戰輒克，賊望見輿軍，相謂曰：「避陶武威。」無敢當者。後與杜弢戰，輿被重創，卒。侃哭之慟，曰：「喪吾家寶！」三軍皆為之垂泣。詔贈長沙太守。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":94,"last_line":94,"raw_start":10182,"raw_end":10418,"raw_character_offsets":[10184,10185,10186,10187,10188,10189,10190,10191,10192,10193,10194,10195,10196,10197,10198,10199,10200,10201,10202,10203,10204,10205,10206,10207,10208,10209,10210,10211,10212,10213,10214,10215,10216,10217,10218,10219,10220,10221,10222,10223,10224,10225,10226,10227,10228,10229,10230,10231,10232,10233,10234,10235,10236,10237,10238,10239,10240,10241,10242,10243,10244,10245,10246,10247,10248,10249,10250,10251,10252,10253,10254,10255,10256,10257,10258,10259,10260,10261,10262,10263,10264,10265,10266,10267,10268,10269,10270,10271,10272,10273,10274,10275,10276,10277,10278,10279,10280,10281,10282,10283,10284,10285,10286,10287,10288,10289,10290,10